{"key":"BrandStudioWindow","text":"## BrandStudioWindow\n\nThe **Brand Studio** is where a client makes the OS their own: rename it,\nrecolor it, skin its buttons and bars, choose fonts and app icons, and decide\nwhich apps their people see. Every edit previews live; **Publish** makes it\neveryone's.\n\n---\n\n@layout\nTabs | 0.50, 0.06 | Company and Legal, Colors, Skins, Fonts and Symbols, Apps. The active tab is underlined in the accent color.\nEditor | 0.50, 0.50 | The fields for the current tab. Empty fields inherit the built-in brand.\nFooter | 0.50, 0.95 | Preview toggle, status line, Inherit All, Reload, and Publish.\n\n---\n\n### Tabs\n\n- **Company and Legal** — OS name, company, support email, website, and the Terms, Privacy and EULA text\n- **Colors** — pick a preset to apply a whole look, then override any of the individual color tokens: tick the box, click the swatch for the color wheel or type a hex value. Hover a name to see where that color appears\n- **Skins** — eleven image slots (button states, title bar, dock, menu, tooltip, input box, the window glyphs). Each has an enable toggle, Choose Image, a Fit mode (Sliced, Tiled, Fit, Fill), edge insets and a tint\n- **Fonts and Symbols** — choose the primary and symbol fonts from the shipped catalog, or Import a .ttf or .otf file\n- **Apps** — one row per app. Click the access box to cycle hidden, everyone, content creators, admins. Change Icon replaces the app icon with a PNG or JPG; Reset Icon restores it\n\n### Footer\n\n- **Preview** — on shows your brand, off shows the original; your edits are kept either way\n- **Inherit All** — clears every override back to the built-in brand\n- **Reload** — fetches the published brand again, discarding unpublished edits\n- **Publish** — saves the brand for everyone\n\n### Who can open it\n\nBrand Studio is admin-only. It opens only when branding is enabled for this\nbuild and you are a Content Creator or Admin; otherwise a toast explains why.\n\n### Where it saves\n\n- The brand itself is Brand/brand.json under SavedData\n- Uploaded fonts, skin images and icons go to Brand/Art\n\n### Shortcuts\n\n- **Cmd/Ctrl+B** — open or restore the Brand Studio (global)\n- **Enter** — commit a typed hex color\n\n### Status: Stable\n### Purpose: OS\n\n---","screenshot":""}